  "description": "Sherpa-onnx-backed speech models for DemaConsulting.Speech: two streaming\n      speech-to-text models and two offline text-to-speech models, installed into a\n      SpeechModelCatalog via the AddSherpaModels() extension method. Reference this package\n      alongside DemaConsulting.Speech to get working, production models out of the box; core\n      DemaConsulting.Speech itself ships with zero built-in models and has no dependency on\n      sherpa-onnx or SharpCompress.",
